   283	
   284	- [ ] Rebuild `train_bc.py` (R) on the new model, reusing Isaiah's optimizer factory, BF16 and compile. Two-rank RTX PRO 6000. Keep the best checkpoint by held-out NLL and stop on sustained held-out degradation (L9). Run statement first. Record the checkpoint SHA-256, the NLL curve and the stopping step.
