   286	## Phase 6 — GPU verification (pod, RTX PRO 6000; Claude operates, Codex reviews receipts)
   287	
   288	- [ ] **6.0 FlashAttention on the pod (blocking for 6.1–6.4):** the GEMM-limit probe found that the pod venv has **no `flash-attn` package**, and the pod's run config had `force_flash_attn: false` (`results.md`, "GEMM limits at our shapes"). Install or build flash-attn 2.8.3 on the pod with `uv sync --extra flash-attn`, and set `force_flash_attn: true`. Verify that the real FlashAttention varlen path runs (import, kernel in use, compiled vs eager on the packed trunk) before any qualification or throughput claim.
   289	- [ ] **6.1 Memory smoke, 2 ranks:** one full iteration with the teacher on and a forced evaluation at dense BC positions. Record peak memory per phase against the ≤ 85% target, teacher cache bytes, native step time and the chosen `native_threads`, confirm the FlashAttention path ran, and record the spm/accum split decision (I1/I3; see "Resource fit").
   290	- [ ] **6.2 Complete-work run, 2 ranks, from the BC best:** 30 min bounded. Report game and learner-seat SPS over complete iterations, 16 optimizer steps per iteration, teacher telemetry, W&B status and whether the L6 fault is absent. Optionally an Nsight capture of one post-warmup iteration.
   291	- [ ] **6.3 Four ranks:** the same denominators for 15 min.
   292	- [ ] **6.4 Orbit end-to-end:** `configs/scaling_6m.yaml`, one GPU, 2 iterations, with a forced evaluation.
